    {
      "assumption": "The current deployment of AI models causes measurable, systemic harm to human agency and social equity.",
      "if_wrong": "If empirical evidence shows AI improves social equity and human cognitive performance, my argument for immediate, restrictive oversight would lose its primary justification."
