    },
    {
      "symbol": "🛡️",
      "tooltip": "Precaution is like a shield, it blocks the blow before the damage is done instead of trying to pay for the wound afterward."
    }
  ],
  "claim_sketches": [
    {
      "claim": "Financial liability is a reactive mechanism that presupposes the existence of a post-failure entity capable of receiving compensation, which is logically incompatible with non-recoverable, civilization-ending events.",
      "targets": ["AN-23"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "By 2026, if we rely solely on financial remediation, we are essentially betting that the 'first error' in an autonomous, high-capability system will be affordable rather than fatal.",
